"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,13,80,82,71,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[29,13,80,82,71,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[29,13,80,82,71,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[29,13,80,82,71,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[29,13,80,82,71,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"11950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10058","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,13,80,82,71,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"11950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"评论家。西汉义阳侯傅介子之后，傅嘏之叔。原仕刘表，早年便以有“知人”之鉴闻名，曾准确品评了庞统、裴潜、魏讽等人的才能与命运。刘表死后见曹操有进取荆州之意，他以理据分析，指出抵抗必败，投降可保富贵，更精准预判了刘备“若胜则反客为主”的潜在风险，最终说服刘琮不战而降，使曹操兵不血刃得到荆州。故被曹操任用，历官丞相东曹掾、侍中、尚书，封关内侯。曹丕称帝后，又官至散骑常侍。","tc":"評論家。西漢義陽侯傅介子之后，傅嘏之叔。原仕劉表，早年便以有“知人”之鑒聞名，曾準確品評了龐統、裴潛、魏諷等人的才能與命運。劉表死后見曹操有進取荊州之意，他以理據分析，指出抵抗必敗，投降可保富貴，更精準預判了劉備“若勝則反客為主”的潛在風險，最終說服劉琮不戰而降，使曹操兵不血刃得到荊州。故被曹操任用，歷官丞相東曹掾、侍中、尚書，封關內侯。曹丕稱帝后，又官至散騎常侍。","en":"A critic. A descendant of Fu Jiezi, the Marquis of Yiyang of the Western Han, and uncle of Fu Jia. He originally served Liu Biao and was celebrated from an early age for his talent in ‘judging character’, accurately assessing the abilities and fates of figures such as Pang Tong, Pei Qian, and Wei Feng. After Liu Biao's death, perceiving Cao Cao's intention to seize Jing Province, he presented a reasoned analysis demonstrating that resistance was futile while surrender would preserve their wealth and status. He further predicted the risk that Liu Bei, if victorious, would ‘turn from guest to master.’ His arguments ultimately persuaded Liu Cong to surrender without resistance, allowing Cao Cao to take Jing Province without bloodshed. He was subsequently employed by Cao Cao, serving as Eastern Division Chief under the Prime Minister, Commandant, and Master of Writing, and was enfeoffed as Marquis Within the Passes. After Cao Pi proclaimed himself emperor, he was further promoted to Cavalier Attendant-in-Ordinary.","jp":"人物批評家。西漢の義陽侯・傅介子の子孫で、傅嘏の叔父。当初は劉表に仕え、早くから人を評価する「知人」の鑑識眼を持つことで知られ、龐統、裴潜、魏諷らの才能や運命を的確に見抜いた。劉表の死後、曹操に荊州進取の意図があると見るや理を説き、抵抗すれば必ず敗れ、降伏すれば富貴を保てることを指摘した。さらに劉備が「勝利すれば主客逆転を招く」という潜在的危機を正確に予見し、最終的に劉琮を説得して戦わずして降伏させ、曹操が血を流さずに荊州を得る契機を作った。これにより曹操に重用され、丞相東曹掾、侍中、尚書を歴任し、関内侯に封じられた。曹丕が皇帝即位した後は、散騎常侍にまで至った。","kr":"인물 비평가. 서한 의양후 부개자의 후손이자 부하의 숙부이다. 본래 유표를 섬겼으며, 젊은 시절부터 사람을 알아보는 안목으로 명성을 떨쳐 방통, 배잠, 위풍 등의 재능과 운명을 정확히 평했다. 유표가 죽은 뒤 조조가 형주를 취하려 하자, 이치에 근거한 분석으로 맞서 싸우면 필패하지만 항복하면 부귀를 보전할 수 있다고 설파했다. 나아가 유비가 '승리하더라도 도리어 주객이 전도될 것'이라는 잠재적 위험까지 정확히 내다보아 마침내 유종을 설득해 싸우지 않고 항복하게 하였고, 조조가 피 한 방울 흘리지 않고 형주를 얻도록 만들었다. 이에 조조에게 등용되어 승상동조연, 시중, 상서를 역임하고 관내후에 봉해졌다. 조비가 칭제한 뒤에는 벼슬이 산기상시에 이르렀다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10560","remark":"","surname":"傅","surnameTc":"傅","surnameEn":"Fu","surnameJp":"傅","surnameKr":"부","surnameOther":"","name":"巽","nameTc":"巽","nameEn":"Xun","nameJp":"巽","nameKr":"손","nameOther":"","word":"公悌","wordTc":"公悌","wordEn":"Gongti","wordJp":"公悌","wordKr":"공제","wordOther":"","icon":"傅巽","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1001","gender":"0","rule":"29","force":"13","wise":"80","politics":"82","charm":"71","will":"71","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"4/4/4/4/4/70/9/4","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1003602;1001501","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"800","battleSoulPoint":"100","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1004208","strategy2":"1000405","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/4/0/3/1/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"25","loyalty":"0","reputation":"11950","evaluate":"1500","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"162","show":"184","death":"230","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1026905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/2;8/1;15/1;26/1;33/1;39/1;18/2;27/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","c